The host's devices for the hosted system's drivers (kexts/): network, input, keystore, system disk and host calls
(bsd/kern/linux64_host.c), the wall clock (IOPlatformExpert), a host-file md disk (memdev), no bootloader NVRAM, and the
stand-ins for Apple's AppleKeyStore and IOAESAccelerator services AMFI and AppleImage4 need.

